      "text": {
        "hi": "जादुई ‘e’! शब्द के आख़िर में ‘e’ खुद नहीं बोलता, पर पहले वाले अक्षर से उसका नाम बुलवाता है। kit बन जाता है kite!",
        "hinglish": "Jaadui ‘e’! Shabd ke aakhir mein ‘e’ khud nahi bolta, par pehle waale akshar se uska naam bulwaata hai. kit ban jaata hai kite!",
        "en": "Magic ‘e’! An ‘e’ at the end is silent, but it makes the letter before it say its name. kit becomes kite!"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L1.U09.S02",
      "skills": [
        "phonics.magic_e"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "kit में ‘i’ छोटा है: इ. kite में ‘e’ के जादू से ‘i’ बोलता है: आइ।",
        "hinglish": "kit mein ‘i’ chhota hai: i. kite mein ‘e’ ke jaadoo se ‘i’ bolta hai: aai.",
        "en": "In kit, ‘i’ is short. In kite, magic ‘e’ makes ‘i’ say its name."
      },
      "word": {
        "english": "kite",
        "emoji": "🪁",
